==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Doge]]s spawn, delay 13.33~20 seconds<sup>400f~600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Snache]]s spawn, delay 20~26.67 seconds<sup>600f~800f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 26.67 seconds<sup>800f</sup>, delay 30~36.67 seconds<sup>900f~1,100f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Moe Uzumasa & Doge]] spawns as the boss.
**1 [[Hippoe]] spawns.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

